1.0.0 public release
1.0.1 Added options(useFancyQuotes = FALSE, scipen = 999) to the top of startModule() to prevent some position ids from being stored in scientific notation.
1.0.1 Updated tests/synTests/buildFauxSites/buildSynData.py to work with genomes with lower case NTs (needed for hs1).
1.0.2 Added additional data fields to multiHitCluster output.
1.0.2 Added --multiHitMinConnectionReads and --multiHitMaxSplitCandidates to buildStdFragments to allow splitting of sub-networks.
1.0.2 Updated module flag help lines. 
